{"channelId":"UCCq9TmJmUxSMoQdvB-rWdGQ","row":["Canine Health Hub",529,"Help your dog feel better - 𝗳𝗿𝗲𝗲 𝗿𝗲𝘀𝗼𝘂𝗿𝗰𝗲𝘀 𝗵𝗲𝗿𝗲👇\n\nLinktr.ee/caninehealthhub\n\nIs your dog slowing down with age? 🐶\nAt Canine Health Hub, we’re here to help you give your senior dog the happy, comfortable, and active life they deserve. 🐕\n\nFrom simple home exercises to safe strengthening routines, you’ll learn how to:\n✨ Support aching joints and stiff muscles\n✨ Build confidence and mobility with fun, gentle activities\n✨ Boost your dog’s energy and quality of life — no expensive equipment needed\n\nThis channel is all about empowering YOU to make your senior dog feel better, move easier, and stay healthier for longer. Because every grey muzzle deserves to thrive. 💛\n\nSubscribe today and join a loving community of senior dog guardians who are making their dogs’ golden years truly shine. 🌟🐕‍🦺","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCCq9TmJmUxSMoQdvB-rWdGQ","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCCq9TmJmUxSMoQdvB-rWdGQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:16.389Z","channelId":"UCCq9TmJmUxSMoQdvB-rWdGQ","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"e97f19f16b7c403f2737f0edb6e6926cf253e29f2a87025f01430dab25c19cb5","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"e7cc793315061b2237e9b54dae4e9f99afcf9f08f730f477f8e628410c5899fd"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCCq9TmJmUxSMoQdvB-rWdGQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:16.389Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCCq9TmJmUxSMoQdvB-rWdGQ","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":529,"raw":"529 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCCq9TmJmUxSMoQdvB-rWdGQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:16.389Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"massage therapist","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"unconfirmed","role":"u